"https://github.com/joe-maley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/1182262702","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/208#issuecomment-1182262702","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/208","id":1182262702,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBlCVUc5Gd-Wu","user":{"login":"joe-maley","id":16864742,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODY0NzQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16864742?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley","html_url":"https://github.com/joe-maley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-07-12T18:51:55Z","updated_at":"2022-07-12T18:51:55Z","body":"1. I realize this ticket is 4+ years old. The `yb-admin` tool no longer outputs the extra output by default. I am only able to reproduce the memory limit reporting by using the `-minloglevel 1` flag.\r\n\r\n2. The memory limit reporting happens in the root tracker. As Bogdan suggested, we can avoid reporting the memory limits in the `yb-admin` and PG logs by only reporting these stats when the master and tserver classes are constructed.\r\n\r\n3.  The `Starting thread pool …` log is just a standard log statement that is generated whenever a `ThreadPool` is constructed. We could do something like introducing a flag into the `ThreadPoolOptions` to control whether or not we print this log statement, but I suspect that this issue isn’t really bloating the code with such a rigid fix. What do you think @bmatican?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/1182262702/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"joe-maley","id":16864742,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODY0NzQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16864742?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley","html_url":"https://github.com/joe-maley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-maley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joe-m